{"issue": "列表分块时最后不足一个分块的元素也需要保留。输入为空时返回空列表，分块大小必须是正整数。", "understanding": {"original_issue": "列表分块时最后不足一个分块的元素也需要保留。输入为空时返回空列表，分块大小必须是正整数。", "summary": "在列表分块时，最后不足一个分块的元素没有被正确保留。", "expected_behavior": "即使不足一个完整的分块，最后的元素也应该被包含在结果中。", "search_query": "list partition incomplete last elements", "scope": "matched", "explanation": "当前实现会在最后一个分块之前停止，而不管该分块是否完整。这导致了不足一个分块的元素丢失。", "targets": [{"ref": "api.py:1", "path": "api.py", "name": "partition", "start_line": 1}], "repository_functions": ["api.py:partition", "api.py:flatten"], "catalog_total": 2, "catalog_shown": 2, "model": "qwen25-7b-unc:latest", "generated_by": "llm", "error": "", "retrieval_mode": "llm_grounded_source"}, "functions": [{"path": "api.py", "symbol": "partition", "type": "function", "is_target": true, "code": "def partition(values, size):
    if size <= 0:
        raise ValueError("size must be positive")
    return [values[i:i + size] for i in range(0, len(values) - size + 1, size)]"}]}
